  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Artist's book from the Painted Faces series, based on the clan masks of the Sepik River tribes and the body art of the Highlands tribes in Papua New Guinea. Each book in the series has a "rattle" inclusion that represents the stick-cracking sound of masali spirits in the night jungle. Each miniature book is a signed, unique variant in its series. The number in parentheses is the completion date of the book.</subfield>
